  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Voluntary Return and Settlement of Internally Displaced People in Kachin State through Right-based Interventions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict-affected and IDP communities pursuing solutions are able to protect themselves by understanding, claiming and exercising their rights., Conflict-affected and displaced communities pursuing solutions build resilience and become more empowered and integrated through realization of SRHR, GBV and MHPSS outcomes., Conflict-affected and displaced communities pursuing solutions can start rebuilding their lives through improved access to basic infrastructure and services., Conflict-affected and IDP communities pursuing solutions are able to safeguard progress and gains through strengthened capacity and preparedness to cope with future shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the ability of conflict-affected, and internally displaced communities pursuing solutions to understand, claim and exercise their rights., Enhance community-resilience and social cohesion, through realization of outcomes, and empowerment in sexual reproductive health and rights, addressing gender-based violence and improving mental health and psychosocial services.,  Improve access to basic infrastructure and services for conflict-affected and displaced communities pursuing solutions., Bolster the ability of conflict-affected and displaced communities  pursuing solutions to cope with future shocks.- IDP &#xad8c;&#xb9ac; &#xbcf4;&#xd638; &#xbc0f; &#xad8c;&#xb9ac; &#xd5a5;&#xc720;&#xb97c; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc774;&#xd574; &#xc99d;&#xc9c4;
- IDP &#xc820;&#xb354;&#xd3ed;&#xb825; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xbc0f; &#xc131;&#xc0dd;&#xc2dd;&#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xc99d;&#xc9c4;
- IDP &#xcee4;&#xbba4;&#xb2c8;&#xd2f0; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xd68c;&#xbcf5;&#xd0c4;&#xb825;&#xc131; &#xac15;&#xd654;
- IDP &#xcee4;&#xbba4;&#xb2c8;&#xd2f0; &#xc7ac;&#xb09c;&#xb300;&#xc751;&#xb825; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
